    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>hueglint — Clarity, not just color.</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;">
      <h1>hueglint</h1>
      <p>Clarity, not just color.</p>
      <Playground client:load />
      <p style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a href="/docs/getting-started/installation/">Get started →</a>
      </p>
      <AccessibilityProof client:visible />
    </main>
  </body>
</html>